        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/26977</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/26977"/>
        <updated>2025-06-03T16:17:44.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=2f3b9dd03c6c4a961d44a632fe1976c73fa19e1f&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Deno doesn't support <code class="notranslate">PerformanceObserver</code>, <code class="notranslate">PerformanceObserverEntryList</code>, and <code class="notranslate">PerformanceResourceTiming</code>.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<p dir="auto">Noticed as part of triaging <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2557255410" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24584" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24584/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24584">#24584</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">Verified locally with Deno v2.3.2, and confirmed with GitHub search:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">PerformanceObserver</code> (<a href="https://github.com/search?q=repo%3Adenoland%2Fdeno+%2FPerformanceObserver%2F&amp;type=code">denoland/deno</a> | <a href="https://github.com/search?q=repo%3Av8%2Fv8%20%2FPerformanceObserver%2F&amp;type=code">v8/v8</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">PerformanceObserverEntryList</code> (<a href="https://github.com/search?q=repo%3Adenoland%2Fdeno+%2FPerformanceObserverEntryList%2F&amp;type=code">denoland/deno</a> | <a href="https://github.com/search?q=repo%3Av8%2Fv8%20%2FPerformanceObserveEntryListr%2F&amp;type=code">v8/v8</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">PerformanceResourceTiming</code> (<a href="https://github.com/search?q=repo%3Adenoland%2Fdeno+%2FPerformanceResourceTiming%2F&amp;type=code">denoland/deno</a> | <a href="https://github.com/search?q=repo%3Av8%2Fv8%20%2FPerformanceResourceTiming%2F&amp;type=code">v8/v8</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<p dir="auto">See also: <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1958756584" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/20961" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/denoland/deno/issues/20961/hovercard?comment_id=2492828204&amp;comment_type=issue_comment" href="https://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/20961#issuecomment-2492828204">denoland/deno#20961 (comment)</a></p>]]></content>
